// ============================================================
// 5. SEED APPOINTMENTS
// Insert 9 appointments using the ObjectIds returned
// from the users insertion above.
// IMPORTANT:
// - Do not hardcode ObjectIds.
// - Use insertResult.insertedIds[index].
// - doctorId and patientId must be BSON ObjectIds.
// ============================================================

